WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.689
there may be occasions where you need to

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.370
send documents out the customers or

00:00:03.689 --> 00:00:08.429
clients where they need to indicate a

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:11.010
preference for a specific item or there

00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:12.840
may be multiple choice to do this within

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.330
word you have the Developer tab where

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:17.369
you can create checkboxes or drop-down

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.840
lists in this video I'm going to

00:00:17.369 --> 00:00:21.449
demonstrate how you can add checkboxes

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:23.789
and drop-down lists to a pre-formatted

00:00:21.449 --> 00:00:25.949
template you can download these

00:00:23.789 --> 00:00:28.769
templates from the page on revision

00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:30.390
Delon website so the first thing I need

00:00:28.769 --> 00:00:32.820
to is I have my template looking on the

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.010
screen and I'm going to add some check

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:38.280
boxes alongside each of these options

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:40.020
the first thing I need to do is to make

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.989
sure that make fears that is placed at

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:45.180
the point where I want to insert the

00:00:41.989 --> 00:00:47.520
drop-down list or checkboxes so I've

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:50.070
moved along there I want to use the tab

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.989
key just to move it along one further

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:54.270
wants to be as further and then I'm

00:00:51.989 --> 00:00:56.820
going to go to the Developer tab and

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:58.559
what I'm on the Developer tab there are

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:00.239
a range of options now the tools that

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:03.329
we're looking for is in the control

00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:05.369
section so if I click on the checkbox

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:08.760
content control and click that it will

00:01:05.369 --> 00:01:14.250
insert a checkbox where the cursor is I

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:17.159
then need to duplicate that throw the

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:20.280
next checkbox and again use the tab key

00:01:17.159 --> 00:01:23.810
to line them up just make sure they're

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:26.000
press the tab key to the lane double

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:31.130
down to the next option

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:35.130
use the tab key to the lane and look and

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:37.350
finally at the last check box now these

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:39.270
boxes should work straight away so you

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:41.640
should be able to check or uncheck these

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:42.689
boxes so a customer could then indicate

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:45.270
their preferences

00:01:42.689 --> 00:01:48.149
however the document hasn't been

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:51.990
protected so customers or anyone can

00:01:48.149 --> 00:01:54.750
actually edit the document which isn't

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:56.670
recommended so what we need to do to

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:58.590
avoid that is to actually protect the

00:01:56.670 --> 00:02:00.479
document so if you look along the

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:04.560
toolbar you can see the restrict editing

00:02:00.479 --> 00:02:06.360
icon and if I click on that it brings up

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:08.789
the range of options on the right-hand

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:11.849
pane so what I want to do is I want to

00:02:08.789 --> 00:02:13.470
restrict the editing so yes it is

00:02:11.849 --> 00:02:14.069
filling in forms who want to allow

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.359
customers

00:02:14.069 --> 00:02:17.909
clients to fill in form so that's

00:02:15.359 --> 00:02:19.109
correct and then select yes start

00:02:17.909 --> 00:02:21.180
enforcing protection

00:02:19.109 --> 00:02:23.780
so once I've checked that that left me

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:33.299
for a password and I will just enter

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:37.500
that password click look here so now

00:02:33.299 --> 00:02:41.969
when I come to edit the document I can

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:45.829
check or uncheck the boxes but I will

00:02:41.969 --> 00:02:48.389
not be able to edit or make any changes

00:02:45.829 --> 00:02:48.870
no matter what a try I can't highlight

00:02:48.389 --> 00:02:50.909
anything

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:54.409
the only editable options within the

00:02:50.909 --> 00:02:54.409
document are other checkboxes